; Actual equations p=(X-x)*u and
; X-x=p*v force p,u,v nonzero. These proofs use the actual
; coefficient-one obstruction and ring product congruence,
; without assuming any factor is nonzero or a unit.
(#alias commutative-ring = ./commutative-ring-data.lim::commutative-ring)
